*                                   V9.3.1
===========================================================================

** DOCUMENTATION

  *** [[FAST-DEMO]]: Add a link to [[README.md#Articles]].
      [[FAST-DEMO]] and [[README.md]] add two recent article and video links:
        [[https://youtu.be/5Oo_KqVcLFM][HyRolo: Records are Trees, Not Lines]]
        [[https://youtu.be/o2KMvSCXwlU][Implicit Buttons: Build Your Hyperverse]]

  *** [[(hyperbole)Cell Attributes]] and [[kotl/EXAMPLE.kotl]]: Add {C-c ; h}
      into the key binding table.  Also, change C-0 to M-0 and C--1 to
      M--1 since control digits don't typically work on a terminal.

  *** [[(hyperbole)Promoting and Demoting]] and [[kotl/EXAMPLE.kotl]]:
      Move {C-c C-]} [[kotl-mode:toggle-tab-flag]] to {C-c [}.

  *** [[(hyperbole)View Specs]] and [[kotl/EXAMPLE.kotl]]:
      Move {C-c ; b} [[kotl-mode:toggle-blank-lines]] to {C-c ]}.

  *** [[(hyperbole)Relocating and Copying]]:
      Move {C-c C-c} [[kotl-mode:copy-before]] to {C-c ; b} to match with
      {C-c ; c} [[kotl-mode:copy-after) binding]].

  *** [[man/use-package]]: Add a commented out  [[hyrolo-file-list]] setting that
      shows all of the note taking systems that can be quickly full-text
      searched with HyRolo with no indexing.

  *** [[man/use-package]]: Add [[hywiki-word-create-exclude-action-key-modes]]
      description of the use and setting of this custom option.

  *** [[man/use-package]]: Add optional [[org-open-link-function]] setting that
      enables highlighting Hyperbole buttons as Org links when wrapped
      in double square brackets.


** HYROLO  (See [[(hyperbole)HyRolo]]).

  *** Optimize [[hyrolo-grep]] by filtering files to search with ripgrep/grep
      to only those with at least one match.


** IMPLICIT BUTTONS  (See [[(hyperbole)Implicit Buttons]]).

  *** [[kbd-key]]: Add support for Org/MediaWiki links around
      curly brace-delimited key series, e.g.. [[{C-h h d d}]].

  *** [[Info-node]]: Allow for Org link square bracket delimiters so can
      match within an [[org-open-link-functions]] call.


** KOUTLINER  (See [[(hyperbole)Koutliner]]).

  *** INCOMPATIBLE CHANGE: Move {C-c C-]} [[kotl-mode:toggle-tab-flag]] to
      {C-c [} for toggling the mode of the {TAB} key, as is
      easier-to-type and is a 'left' opening brace like left 'TAB' key.

  *** INCOMPATIBLE CHANGE: Move {C-c ; b} [[kotl-mode:toggle-blank-lines]]
      to {C-c ]}.
      Move {C-c C-c} [[kotl-mode:copy-before]] to {C-c ; b} to match with
      {C-c ; c} [[kotl-mode:copy-after) binding]].  {C-c C-c} no longer
      worked because Org-compatibility overrode its binding.


** PROGRAMMING INTERFACE CHANGES  (See [[(hyperbole)Embedding Hyperbole]]).

  *** [[hywiki-org-get-heading-match-regexp]]: Allow for indented Org
      headings.

  *** [[hywiki-word-create-exclude-action-key-modes]]: Add to support major
      modes where an Action Key press on a potential HyWikiWord does not
      create it or a blank page of notes for it.

  *** Add [[smart-prog-to-definition]] for use in [[org-open-link-functions]].
      Used in "README.md".

