*                                   V9.3.0
===========================================================================

** DOCUMENTATION

  *** Document changes to Koutliner {C-c <letter>} key bindings in:
        man/use-package (kotl-mode:letter-prefix)
        man/hyperbole.texi (Koutliner, Koutliner Keys)
        kotl/EXAMPLE.kotl

  *** [[(hyperbole)Hiding and Showing]]: Remove Koutline tree visibility
      cycling from the Action Key default context since it is now on
      the {TAB} key.

  *** Update [[smart-org]] documentation in [[(hyperbole)Smart-Key - Org Mode]]
      and (hyperbole)Implicit Button Types]] to reflect:
        1.  new Org-style visibility cycling on the {TAB} and {S-TAB} keys.

        2.  new settings to control Action and Assist Key behavior when
            within a heading (defaults are no-ops):
            [[smart-org-action-key-heading-function]] and
            [[smart-org-assist-key-heading-function]].  The new [[smart-org-cycle]]
            command is one option for such as setting.

  *** [[kotl/EXAMPLE.kotl]]:
      [[(hyperbole)Promoting and Demoting]]: Remove {M-0 TAB} and {M-0 S-TAB}
      for demoting and promoting within Org tables as M-0 is used as a flag to
      these commands to also fill cells.  Additionally, these bindings worked
      only when 'kotl-mode:tab-flag' /= 'cycle.

  *** [[(hyperbole)Hyperbole Overview]]: Add HyWiki summary.
      [[(hyperbole)Installation and Configuration]]: Update this section.

  *** New names for these manual sections:
     [[(hyperbole)Tarball Install]] and [[(hyperbole)Package Installation]].

  *** Makefile (README.md): Now generated from [[README.in.md]] and includes
      a copy of "man/use-package" in the Installation section (which
      replaces the now deleted "INSTALL" file.

  *** man/use-package (iimage-mode): Add note on how to permanently enable
      inline image display in Koutline buffers.

  *** man/use-package: Add commented out settings for customization of
      [[hyrolo-file-list]] and  [[hywiki-directory]].


** HYROLO  (See [[(hyperbole)HyRolo]]).

  *** INCOMPATIBLE CHANGE: In [[hyrolo-yank]], interactively, `regexp-flag' is
      set only if prefix arg is not C-u, as C-u now disables the 3rd arg,
      `exclude-sub-entries'.  Interactively, indicate whether yanking an
      entry or a tree (sub-entries).


** IMPLICIT BUTTONS  (See [[(hyperbole)Implicit Buttons]]).

  *** [[hywiki-word]] matching can now be customized to limit which major modes
      allow HyWikiWord creaton via the {M-RET} Action Key.  Add any such
      text or programming modes to [[hywiki-word-create-exclude-action-key-modes]].
      Then this ibtype will use [[hywiki-word-action-key-creation-allowed-p]]
      to check for a valid mode.  You can bypass this setting by creating
      a HyWikiWord via the keyboard menu with {C-h h h c}.


** KOUTLINER  (See [[(hyperbole)Koutliner]]).

  *** Add {C-c C-x C-v} bound to [[iimage-mode]] for toggling inline image display
      like in Org mode.

  *** In [[kotl-mode:setup-keymap]] add {C-c C-]} key binding for
      [[kotl-mode:toggle-tab-flag]] to toggle {TAB} and {S-TAB} between
      Org-style visibility cycling and tree demotion/promotion.

  *** Remove {M-1 TAB} for toggling TAB/S-TAB functions for greater Org
      compatibility.  Remove {M-0 TAB} and {M-0 S-TAB} for tree
      demotion/promotion when not in Org-style cycle mode.  Existing
      bindings of {C-c C-.} or {M-right} and {C-c C-,} or {M-left} for tree
      demotion/promotion always work regardless of TAB mode.

  *** INCOMPATIBLE CHANGE: In [[kotl-mode:setup-keymap]], by default, move all
      {C-c <letter>} key bindings to {C-c ; <letter>} so do not override keys
      reserved for user-specific key bindings.  The new {M-1 C-c C-l} will
      toggle the old {C-c <letter>} bindings back on/off when desired for
      users who don't care about overriding global bindings.  Alternatively,
      you can also modify the new [[kotl-mode:letter-prefix]] in your Hyperbole
      `use-package' setup to use any prefix you prefer.

  *** INCOMPATIBLE CHANGE: Previously in Koutlines, the {M-RET} Action Key
      default action when no matching context was found was to run
      [[kotl-mode:show-or-hide-tree]].  Now instead it calls the function
      specified by the new [[kotl-mode:action-key-default-function]], which
      defaults to a no-op, since Koutline tree visibility cycling is now
      on the {TAB} key by default.

  *** INCOMPATIBLE CHANGE: Previously in Koutlines, the {C-u M-RET} Assist
      Key default action when no matching context was found was to run
      [[smart-scroll-down]].  Now instead it calls the function specified
      by the new [[kotl-mode:assist-key-default-function]], which defaults
      to a no-op, for symmetry with the Action Key.

  *** INCOMPATIBLE CHANGE: Remove {M-TAB} binding since often used to
      switch applications.  Use {S-TAB} instead.


** ORG MODE INTEGRATION (See [[(hyperbole)Smart Key - Org Mode]]).

  *** New Action and Assist Key settings for the action to run when pressed
      on an Org heading if [[hsys-org-enable-smart-keys]] is set to t:
      [[smart-org-action-key-heading-function]] and
      [[smart-org-assist-key-heading-function]].  Both of these default to
      no-ops.  The new [[smart-org-cycle]] command is one possible command to
      set them to, though {TAB} will do that by default now.

