** IMPLICIT BUTTONS  (See [[(hyperbole)Implicit Buttons]]).

  *** Klink Pathnames: Handle #relative-id=idstamp syntax at the end of a
      pathname to display the specified Koutline cell.  Also, update
      relative-id if need be when the link is activated.

      When Hyperbole is prompting to create a klink referring to a cell
      in the current buffer, {M-RET} pressed twice on a cell will use
      that cell as the referent and the link will be inserted now without
      the file path, i.e. <@ relative-id=idstamp>.


** KOUTLINER  (See [[(hyperbole)Koutliner]]).

  *** Org-style Cycling: {TAB} and {S-TAB} emulate Org-style visibility
      cycling, by default, when pressed in a context other than ones
      covered by the `kotl-mode:emulate-tab' setting.  Remove {M-TAB}
      as a binding for promoting trees outside of Org tables since often
      used to switch applications under a window system.

   .  {TAB} cycles the tree rooted at point and {S-TAB} cycles the whole
      outline.  See [[(hyperbole)TAB and Shift-TAB]].

      Numeric prefix arguments show a single line for each cell down to
      the prefix argument level.  Zero shows one line of all levels.

      See [[(hyperbole)Org-style Visibility Cycling]]
      and [[(hyperbole)Promoting and Demoting]] for summary tables of {TAB}
      and {S-TAB} behavior.

  *** {C-c [} runs [[kotl-mode:toggle-tab-flag]] which sets the value of
      [[kotl-mode:tab-flag]] and toggles {TAB} and {S-TAB} between Org-style
      cycling and demoting and promoting outline trees.

